---
title: "lock (Sui Framework: kiosk)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_access: assert self.has_access(cap)
    q_check_access --> q_abort: no access
    q_abort --> [*]: abort ENotOwner
    q_check_access --> q_lock_internal: has access
    q_lock_internal --> q_add_lock: df::add(Lock(id), true)
    q_add_lock --> q_place: place_internal(item)
    q_place --> q_inc_count: self.item_count + 1
    q_inc_count --> [*]: item locked in kiosk

    note right of q_lock_internal
        INV-001: requires TransferPolicy to exist (prevents permanent locking)
        INV-002: locked items can only exit via list+purchase flow
        INV-003: lock is stored as dynamic field on kiosk
    end note
